  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d1mY0f51/Advanced-Netherite-Banner-V13fabric.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><h1><strong>Advanced Netherite (Fabric)</strong></h1><p><em>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>！</em></p><p>這是 <strong>Fabric</strong> 版本，按一下<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>前往 Forge / NeoForge 版本。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>📖 關於</strong></h3><p><strong>Advanced Netherite</strong> 是一款貼近原版且開源的模組，為 Minecraft 添加了更多階段的獄髓！\n本模組的目標是透過增加更多可達成的目標來延伸原版 Minecraft 的體驗。</p><p>更多資訊請造訪 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetheriteFabric/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite Wiki</a>！</p><p>感謝 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LizterZapZap\" rel=\"nofollow\">LizterZapZap</a> 創作全新且改進的材質！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>✅ 特色</strong></h3><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MTdvpvZ2/Advanced-Netherite-Features-V11fabric.png\" alt=\"特色\"></a></p><ul>\n<li>4 個 <strong>全新</strong> 獄髓階段！</li>\n<li>每個新的獄髓階段都包含一套工具、一套盔甲和方塊</li>\n<li>每個獄髓階段都有其獨特的屬性（特殊盔甲增益、工具額外掉落物）</li>\n<li>支援附加元件和資料包</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>💎 獄髓階段</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MT1VXszQ/Types-Of-Netherite-Banner-V2.png\" alt=\"階段\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>🔨 合成配方</strong></h3><p>請查閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki/Crafting-Recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite Wiki</a> 以了解所有合成配方，或安裝一個配方檢視模組。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>🔖 熱門版本連結</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.11\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.19.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.18.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>ℹ 更多資訊</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>請將問題回報至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetheriteFabric/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 上的問題追蹤器</a>！</li>\n<li>我可以在我的模組包中使用你的模組嗎？是的，絕對可以！</li>\n<li>在此查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge &amp; NeoForge 版本</a>！</li>\n<li>按一下<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>查看更多圖片！</li>\n<li>造訪 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite Wiki</a> 以了解本模組添加內容的更多資訊。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>💬 加入我的 Discord 伺服器！</strong></h3><p><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KP3BBatuw5\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我的 Discord 伺服器</a>，以便在有新更新、模組支援等資訊時獲得通知！</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h4><strong>⚠️ 免責聲明</strong></h4><p>本模組僅透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetheriteFabric/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 GitHub 儲存庫</a>發佈。\n請勿重新發布本模組<em>或</em>從其他來源下載本模組。</p><p>有關模組重新發布的更多詳細資訊以及如何保護自己免受其害，請造訪：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstopmodreposts.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">stopmodreposts.org</a>。</p>",
